{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Deep Timer 是一款極簡的冥想計時器，沒有社群動態、課程或註冊流程，只留下一個一按即開始的計時畫面。無論是剛剛起步的初學者，還是練習多年的靜坐者，都能藉它把注意力放回當下。原價 US $3.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>靜坐計時不受打擾</h2>\n<p>設定時長後一按即開始，暖身與緩和階段讓你自然進入與離開，每個階段以平和鈴聲提示。你可為日常練習儲存預設組合，晨間短靜坐或晚間長靜坐一按即可切換。應用會記錄連續日數、貢獻圖表、總時數與最長連續紀錄。所有紀錄只儲存於裝置，沒有帳戶與追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-33.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-37.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-38.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Deep Timer – Meditation Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T12:38:02.687771+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}